sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Shopper
    participant W as Web
    participant O as Orders
    participant P as Payments
    U->>+W: checkout
    W->>+O: create order
    activate O
    alt card payment with 3-D secure challenge required
        O->>+P: charge card
        P-->>-O: challenge
        Note right of P: user must confirm in bank app
    else wallet balance is sufficient for this order
        O->>O: debit wallet
    else
        O-->>W: unsupported
    end
    deactivate O
    O-->>-W: order id
    par notify by e-mail and also by push
        W->>U: email
    and update the analytics pipeline
        W->>P: settle
    end
    W-->>-U: done
